      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W643_Task16" name="Employee receives final pay with itemized computation document; HR Business…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: Employee receives final pay with itemized computation document; HR Business Partner obtains signed acknowledgment
Responsible (R): HR Business Partner
Accountable (A): HR Manager
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W643_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
