        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-297 (ensure controlled execution — Payroll &amp; Compensation (PA-19.2).) | - operational: Payroll Manager computation review; DOLE 30-day final-pay compliance tracking; separation-pay formula validation per cause type; signed employee acknowledgment of final pay | ---
Owner: Payroll Specialist</bpmn:text>
